T-103-nav-992-breakpoint-fix — 2026-09-11
Nguon: known_gap tu-ghi-nhan trong T-102 ("nav header-menu bi chat nhe dung o 992px, TPCN/
KHUYEN MAI/BLOG khong hien du") — xu ly theo /goal "update giao dien moi ngay" (Single Task
Focus, khong co next_task nao khac trong tam tay khong can nguoi dung quyet dinh).

ROOT CAUSE (xac nhan qua Playwright page.on('pageerror') THAT, khong doan):
- assets/main.js.bwt dong 52: `var wDWs = $(window).width();` (do 1 lan luc load script).
- Dong 353 (truoc sua): `if (wDWs > 992) { function horizontalNav() {...} }` — Ở DUNG 992px,
  dieu kien SAI (`>` khong bao gom 992) => ham horizontalNav KHONG duoc dinh nghia.
- Dong 385: `$(document).ready(...)` lai dung `window.matchMedia('(min-width: 992px)').matches`
  (BAO GOM 992px) de goi `horizontalNav().init()` => o dung 992px, JS nem loi that:
  "horizontalNav is not a function" (bat duoc qua page.on('pageerror') that, khong suy doan).
- Loi nay lam DUNG toan bo phan con lai cua handler khong chay: khong bind click #prev/#next,
  khong them class `.overflow` cho phep cuon ngang khi nav qua dai — nen 2 muc cuoi (KHUYEN MAI,
  BLOG) bi `.col-menu{overflow:hidden}` che khuat VINH VIEN, khong co cach nao tiep can duoc o
  dung 992px (khac voi 993px+ da hoat dong dung, va <992px chuyen sang mobile drawer).

FIX: doi dieu kien dong 353 tu `wDWs > 992` thanh `wDWs >= 992` — khop dung nguong
matchMedia('(min-width:992px)') dang dung o duoi, dam bao ham horizontalNav LUON duoc dinh
nghia truoc khi bi goi tai chinh xac 992px. 1 dong sua, khong dong CSS/HTML nao khac.

VERIFY (E2 — Playwright thuc):
1. page.on('pageerror') tai viewport 992x900: TRUOC sua co loi "horizontalNav is not a
   function"; SAU sua: 0 loi loai nay (chi con 1 canh bao 404 asset khong lien quan, da co tu
   truoc, khong thuoc pham vi task nay).
2. page.evaluate xac nhan: `.navigation-horizontal.overflow` = true, `#next` khong con class
   `unactive` (nut hoat dong).
3. Click that vao #next: nav cuon dung, ca 6 muc (gom KHUYEN MAI, BLOG truoc do bi che) deu vao
   duoc vung nhin — screenshot truoc/sau xac nhan (header-t103-992-before.png,
   header-t103-992-after-next.png).
4. npm run build: PASS (818ms). npx playwright test (KHONG --update-snapshots, vi fix JS nay chi
   anh huong dung tai 992px, khong doi bat ky viewport nao trong bo test hien co): 39/39 PASS
   nguyen ban - xac nhan 0 regression thi giac o cac do rong da test.
5. compliance-lint: 0 vi pham cung, 18 canh bao danh xung khong doi.

EVIDENCE_GRADE: E2 (Playwright pageerror that + click that + build/test log that).
